title: Password form on a new domain
severity: high
score: 45
tags: phishing, newly-registered
attack: T1566.002, T1583.001
description: A page asks for a password and the final domain is less than 30 days old.
---
// A password field ...
password_pages
// ... on a final domain registered less than 30 days ago.
| where toscalar(final_domain | project age_days) < 30
| project url, domain_age_days = toscalar(final_domain | project age_days)
